<div class='cd-cell cd-hasheader' style='padding:20px 0px 0px 0px;'>
<div class='cd-header cd-header-2thirds'>
<div class='titleline'>
<h2 class='titleline-title'>Basel Committee</h2>
<div class='titleline-line'></div>
</div>
</div>
<a href='/bcbs/index.htm' style='display:block;'>
<img alt='BCBS image' src='/img/homepage/bcbs.jpg' style='box-sizing:border-box;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0px;border:1px solid #dbdbdb;'>
</a>
The
<a href='/bcbs/index.htm'>Basel Committee on Banking Supervision</a>
aims to enhance understanding of the key supervisory issues and improve the quality of banking supervision worldwide. The
<a href='/bcbs/basel3.htm'>Basel III</a>
page summarises the Committee's post-crisis reforms.
</div>
<div class='cd-cell cd-hasfooter' style='padding-top:20px;'>
